# Background or Cron Job

- File location: under ``src/jobs`` folder
- File name: ``FEATURE.job.ts`` 
- Each job file has only one exported default function
- The default exported method accept the interval configuration as first parameter
- The job executed based on the ``interval`` parameter
- No extra export member is defined
- The job process is separated from the job running eg:

```ts
const function processJob() {
  ----
}

const JOB_INTERVAL = '*** JOB INTERVAL FORMAT ***';
export default function runJob(inverval: string = JOB_INTERVAL) {
  /* spawn the job based on ``intervall`` */
}
```
